Scope: this proves physical identity and a partial bounded Message/inventory audit. It checks typed SCHEDULED timeline/expiry indexes, reports conservative status dispositions, verifies Message and terminal-summary Attempt forward references, and detects unreferenced recognized INFLIGHT Attempt ledgers. It does not compare complete current Message and Terminal summary state/ref sets, close Claim/Admission/Journal or other owner/proof relationships, validate old TimelineEntry/Profile semantics, terminal/Floor owners or Lane control, replay source bytes after the checkpoint, produce the full per-Shard dry-run report, establish durable migration activation, convert a Store, or authorize rollback/reader retirement. B6 remains `IN_PROGRESS / PENDING_CENTRAL_VALIDATION`.
